## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical use of SageMaker features to handle multilingual adapters with zero-downtime updates and strict latency SLAs.

## Key Concepts

- SageMaker Model Registry and Endpoint Variants
- Canary deployments and per-language traffic routing
- Drift and latency validation; per-language observability
- Rollback and promotion criteria; cross-region considerations

